# Global rules

- Figma node `2076:14773` is the visual source of truth.
- Cake& v4.2.4 is the component and token source of truth.
- Reuse Cake& components before writing custom UI.
- Use only Cake& CSS custom properties for visual values.
- Preserve Figma-provided assets and their geometry.
- Meet WCAG 2.2 AA and retain visible keyboard focus.
- Keep local mock data separate from presentation.
- Do not add another component or styling system.
